<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of an English Premier</p>
<p>league soccer match on Monday:</p>
<p>Sheffield Wednesday 2 (Orlando Trustfull 63, Benito Carbone 85) Nottingham Forest 0 (halftime 0-0). Attendance: 16,390.</p>
